We’re heading to the Minnesota State Fair on Monday, August 31, 2026 for a day of ridiculous amounts of food, questionable financial decisions involving things on a stick, people watching, wandering the fairgrounds, and plenty of laughs with some damn good people.

There’s no formal agenda and no pressure to keep up with the whole group all day. Come hang out, grab some food, check out the exhibits, hit the Midway, hunt down your favorite fair food, or just enjoy being out with people who get it.

Community Connections is about exactly that: connection. Getting out of the house, doing something fun, meeting new people, reconnecting with familiar faces, and taking a break from everything else life throws at us.

Whether this is your first Community Connections adventure or you’ve joined us before, you’re welcome.

Come hungry. Wear comfortable shoes. Bring your sense of humor. Let the State Fair Shenanigans begin. 🎡🐷🍺🍪', 'Expect a relaxed, welcoming atmosphere with plenty of time to connect, have fun, and enjoy the adventure at your own pace. Final meetup instructions and any important updates will be shared with registered participants.', 'Bring weather-appropriate clothing, any personal items you need for the day, water, and a good attitude. Check the special notes for adventure-specific equipment or requirements.', '', 'This is a member-organized Community Connections adventure and is not facilitated, monitored, or organized by IWP staff. Please watch for organizer updates before the event.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 0, '', NULL, NULL, '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, 0, 1, 'https://www.etix.com/ticket/v/8597?partner_id=4584&utm_source=admission+tickets&utm_medium=website&utm_campaign=admission+tickets&_gl=1*3d1q2l*_ga*MTA1Mjk0MDA4NC4xNzg1MzY4MzIz*_ga_GHVREX2ZJQ*czE3ODUzODU4MzYkbzMkZzEkdDE3ODUzODU4NTkkajM3JGwwJGg5NDAyMzQyMjM.', NULL, 0, 'Shane Hendricks', '', '', '', 0, '', '', 'sandmannd@gmail.com', '2026-07-29T23:42:33.187Z', '2026-08-11T01:19:02.561Z');
